 I neurons. In the enteric nervous system, Dogiel type II neurons correspond to intrinsic primary afferent neurons and exhibit AH-type electrophysiology, characterized by a prolonged afterhyperpolarization following an action potential.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052072 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052072 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052072 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052072 \"type II enteric neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052072 \"multiaxonal enteric neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052072 \"AH neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052072 \"Dogiel II neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052072 \"dogiel type II neuron\")\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052072 obo:CL_0000540)\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052073 (intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37355216\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:40954253\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052073 \"A sensory enteric neuron whose soma resides in the myenteric plexus and which functions as the afferent limb of intrinsic reflex circuits controlling motility, secretion, and blood flow. This neuron is characterized by Dogiel type II morphology, AH-type electrophysiology, immunopositivity for choline acetyltransferase, and immunonegativity for neuronal nitric oxide synthase.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052073 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052073 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052073 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052073 \"IPAN\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052073 \"myenteric sensory neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37355216\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052073 \"multiaxonal cholinergic myenteric sensory neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052073 \"intrinsic primary afferent neuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4052073 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000101 obo:CL_0007011 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002439)))\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052073 obo:CL_4052072)\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052074 (interneuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32888429\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:40954253\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052074 \"An interneuron of the enteric nervous system whose soma resides in the myenteric plexus. This neuron integrates sensory input from intrinsic primary afferent neurons and modulates motor output to smooth muscle and secretory epithelia by synapsing onto motor neurons and other interneurons within the plexus.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052074 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052074 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052074 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052074 \"enteric interneuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052074 \"interneuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4052074 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000099 obo:CL_0007011 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002439)))\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052075 (secretomotor/vasodilator neuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32888429\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:40954253\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052075 \"An enteric neuron whose soma resides in the myenteric plexus and which controls mucosal secretion and blood flow by innervating secretory epithelia and submucosal blood vessels. This neuron is characterized by expression of vasoactive intestinal peptide; in mouse, both non-cholinergic and cholinergic subtypes have been identified, whereas in human a VIP-positive non-cholinergic subtype has been detected.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052075 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052075 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052075 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052075 \"PSVN\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32888429\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052075 \"VIP-positive secretomotor neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052075 \"secretomotor/vasodilator neuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052075 obo:CL_0007011)\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052075 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002439))\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052076 (intestinofugal neuron)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38292899\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:40954253\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052076 \"An enteric neuron whose soma resides in the myenteric plexus of the intestine and whose axon projects outside the gut wall to synapse on neurons in prevertebral sympathetic ganglia. In humans, most of these neurons are immunopositive for choline acetyltransferase.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052076 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052076 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052076 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38292899\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4052076 \"viscerofugal neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38292899\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052076 \"VFN\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:38292899\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052076 \"cholinergic viscerofugal neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052076 \"intestinofugal neuron\")\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052076 obo:CL_0007011)\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052076 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002439))\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052077 (ascending interneuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:40954253\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052077 \"An interneuron of the myenteric plexus whose axon projects orally along the gut axis. This neuron forms the excitatory limb of ascending reflex pathways that coordinate peristalsis.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052077 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052077 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052077 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052077 \"cholinergic enkephalinergic myenteric interneuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052077 \"ascending myenteric interneuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052077 \"ascending interneuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052077 obo:CL_4052074)\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052078 (descending interneuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:40954253\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052078 \"An interneuron of the myenteric plexus whose axon projects aborally along the gut axis. This neuron class encompasses multiple chemically diverse subtypes, including serotonergic and nitrergic populations, and forms the inhibitory limb of descending reflex pathways.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052078 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052078 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052078 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052078 \"descending myenteric interneuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052078 \"descending interneuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+SubClassOf(obo:CL_4052078 obo:CL_4052074)\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052079 (stubby Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37355216\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052079 \"A Dogiel type I enteric motor neuron of the myenteric plexus characterized by stubby lamellar dendrites with broad, flattened dendritic expansions. This neuron corresponds to an excitatory motor neuron of the enteric nervous system.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052079 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052079 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052079 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052079 \"stubby Dogiel I neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052079 \"lamellar Dogiel type I neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052079 \"stubby Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4052079 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000100 obo:CL_4047038 obo:CL_0007011))\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052080 (spiny Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37355216\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052080 \"A Dogiel type I enteric inhibitory motor neuron of the myenteric plexus characterized by spiny dendrites with numerous short projections along the dendrites.\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_4052080 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3584>)\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:creator obo:CL_4052080 \"GitHub Copilot\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4052080 \"2026-05-17T00:00:00Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4052080 \"spiny Dogiel I neuron\")\n+AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4052080 \"spiny Dogiel type I neuron of myenteric plexus\")\n+EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4052080 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0008015 obo:CL_4047038 obo:CL_0007011))\n+\n+# Class: obo:CL_4052081 (dogiel type II neuron of myenteric plexus)\n+\n+AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34170401\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37355216\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:40954253\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4052081 \"An intrinsic primary afferent neuron of the myenteric plexus characterized 